WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Narrator: Twenty minutes to kick-off at Gate 4.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.600
Narrator: A family is at the incorrect gate number.

3
00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.990
Narrator: A ticket won't scan.

4
00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:13.590
Omar: I paid for this!

5
00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:17.380
Narrator: And inside, two fans have tickets for the same seat.

6
00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:20.580
Narrator: Three problems - and the queue keeps coming.

7
00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:24.080
Narrator: What would you do first?
